 kho\'b6n l\'e7 \'ae\'e3, th\'eai gian chuy\'d3n l\'e7 kh\'abng qu\'b8 5 n\'a8m k\'d3 t\'f5 n\'a8m ngay sau n\'a8m ph\'b8t sinh l\'e7.
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 8. Khi chuy\'d3n l\'eei nhu\'cbn ra n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i, c\'b8c Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i kh\'abng ph\'b6i n\'e9p thu\'d5 chuy\'d3n thu nh\'cbp ra n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i \'ae\'e8i v\'ed
i thu nh\'cbp c\'f1a c\'b8c n\'a8m t\'b5i ch\'ddnh k\'d3 t\'f5 n\'a8m t\'b5i ch\'ddnh 1999 tr\'eb \'aei.
\par 
\par }{\b\f15\fs26\cgrid0 III. \'a7\'a8ng k\'fd, k\'aa khai, n\'e9p thu\'d5, quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 thu nh\'cbp doanh nghi\'d6p:
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\b\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 1.\'a7\'a8ng k\'fd thu\'d5:
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i c\'e3 tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m \'ae\'a8ng k\'fd thu\'d5 thu nh\'cbp doanh nghi\'d6p v\'edi c\'ac quan thu\'d5 \'ae\'dea ph\'ad\'acng (C\'f4c thu\'d5 t\'d8nh, Th\'b5nh ph
\'e8 tr\'f9c thu\'e9c trung \'ad\'acng) n\'aci \'ae\'e3ng tr\'f4 s\'eb c\'f1a Chi nh\'b8nh.  
\par 
\par 2.K\'aa khai thu\'d5:
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 Chi nh\'b8nh  n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i ph\'b6i c\'e3 tr\'b8ch nhi\'d6m k\'aa khai v\'b5 n\'e9p t\'ea khai thu\'d5 t\'b9m n\'e9p c\'b6 n\'a8m theo m\'c9u qui \'ae\'denh t\'b9i Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8
 99/1998/TT-BTC c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh cho c\'ac quan thu\'d5 tr\'f9c ti\'d5p qu\'b6n l\'fd ch\'cbm nh\'cat v\'b5o ng\'b5y 25 th\'b8ng 1 h\'b5ng n\'a8m. 
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 C\'a8n c\'f8 \'ae\'d3 k\'aa khai l\'b5 k\'d5t qu\'b6 s\'b6n xu\'cat, kinh doanh, d\'dech v\'f4 c\'f1a n\'a8m tr\'ad\'edc v\'b5 kh\'b6 n\'a8ng kinh doanh c\'f1a n\'a8m ti\'d5p theo.
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 Sau khi nh\'cbn \'ae\'ad\'eec t\'ea khai, c\'ac quan thu\'d5 ki\'d3m tra x\'b8c \'ae\'denh s\'e8 t\'b9m n\'e9p c\'b6 n\'a8m v\'b5 chia ra t\'f5ng qu\'fd \'ae\'d3 th\'abng b\'b8o cho Chi nh\'b8nh n
\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9m n\'e9p thu\'d5.
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 N\'d5u trong t\'ea khai, Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i kh\'abng k\'aa khai ho\'c6c ho\'c6c k\'aa khai kh\'abng r\'e2 c\'b8c c\'a8n c\'f8 \'ae\'d3 x\'b8c \'ae\'denh s\'e8 thu\'d5 t\'b9m n\'e9p c
\'b6 n\'a8m th\'d7 c\'ac quan thu\'d5 c\'e3 quy\'d2n y\'aau c\'c7u Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i gi\'b6i tr\'d7nh c\'b8c c\'a8n c\'f8 \'ae\'d3 x\'b8c \'ae\'denh s\'e8 thu\'d5 t\'b9m n\'e9p c\'b6 n\'a8m. Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo
\'b5i kh\'abng gi\'b6i tr\'d7nh ho\'c6c kh\'abng ch\'f8ng minh \'ae\'ad\'eec c\'b8c c\'a8n c\'f8 \'ae\'b7 ghi trong t\'ea khai theo y\'aau c\'c7u c\'f1a c\'ac quan thu\'d5 th\'d7 c\'ac quan thu\'d5 c\'e3 quy\'d2n \'can \'ae\'denh s\'e8 thu\'d5 t\'b9m n
\'e9p c\'f1a c\'b6 n\'a8m. 
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 3.N\'e9p thu\'d5: 
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9m n\'e9p thu\'d5 h\'b5ng qu\'fd \'ae\'c7y \'ae\'f1, \'ae\'f3ng h\'b9n theo th\'abng b\'b8o thu\'d5 c\'f1a c\'ac quan thu\'d5 . 
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 Th\'eai h\'b9n n\'e9p thu\'d5 \'ae\'ad\'eec ghi trong th\'abng b\'b8o n\'e9p thu\'d5 ch\'cbm nh\'cat kh\'abng qu\'b8 ng\'b5y cu\'e8i qu\'fd.    
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 4.Quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 :
\par Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i ph\'b6i th\'f9c hi\'d6n quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 v\'edi c\'ac quan thu\'d5 v\'b5 ph\'b6i k\'aa khai c\'b8c ch\'d8 ti\'aau theo m\'c9u qui \'ae\'denh t\'b9i Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8 99/1998/TT-BTC ng\'b5y 14/7/1998 c\'f1a B\'e9
 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh.
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 N\'a8m quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 thu nh\'cbp doanh nghi\'d6p \'aeu\'eec t\'ddnh theo n\'a8m d\'ad\'acng l\'dech b\'bet \'ae\'c7u t\'f5 ng\'b5y 1 th\'b8ng 1 v\'b5 k\'d5t th\'f3c v\'b5o ng\'b5y 31 th
\'b8ng 12 c\'efng n\'a8m. Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p \'b8p d\'f4ng n\'a8m t\'b5i ch\'ddnh kh\'b8c v\'edi n\'a8m d\'ad\'acng l\'dech n\'aau tr\'aan th\'d7 \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 theo n
\'a8m t\'b5i ch\'ddnh \'ae\'e3.
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i ph\'b6i n\'e9p b\'b8o c\'b8o t\'d7nh h\'d7nh s\'b6n xu\'cat kinh doanh, b\'b8o c\'b8o k\'d5 to\'b8n \'ae\'b7 \'ae\'ad\'eec ki\'d3m to\'b8n b\'ebi m\'e9t t\'e6 ch
\'f8c ki\'d3m to\'b8n \'ae\'e9c l\'cbp \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'d0p ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng t\'b9i Vi\'d6t nam, b\'b8o c\'b8o quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 thu nh\'cbp doanh nghi\'d6p cho c\'ac quan thu\'d5 tr\'f9c ti\'d5p qu\'b6n l\'fd trong th\'eai h\'b9n 60 ng\'b5y k
\'d3 t\'f5 ng\'b5y k\'d5t th\'f3c n\'a8m t\'b5i ch\'ddnh.  
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\b\f15\fs26\cgrid0 IV. T\'e6 ch\'f8c th\'f9c hi\'d6n:
\par }\pard \qj\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 
\par }\pard \qj\fi720\nowidctlpar\adjustright {\f15\fs26\cgrid0 Th\'abng t\'ad n\'b5y c\'e3 hi\'d6u l\'f9c thi h\'b5nh sau 15 ng\'b5y k\'d3 t\'f5 ng\'b5y k\'fd v\'b5 \'b8p d\'f4ng cho vi\'d6c k\'aa khai, quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 thu nh\'cbp doanh nghi\'d6p c
\'f1a c\'b8c Chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i k\'d3 t\'f5 n\'a8m t\'b5i ch\'ddnh b\'bet \'ae\'c7u trong n\'a8m 1999.
\par  
\par Tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep tr\'ad\'edc ng\'b5y c\'e3 hi\'d6u l\'f9c c\'f1a Th\'abng t\'ad n\'b5y m\'b5 chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i \'ae\'b7 th\'f9c hi\'d6n quy\'d5t to\'b8n thu\'d5 thu nh\'cbp doanh nghi\'d6p n\'a8m t\'b5i ch\'ddnh 1999 theo c\'b8c h\'ad
\'edng d\'c9n tr\'ad\'edc \'ae\'a9y c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh (thu\'d5 su\'cat thu\'d5 TNDN 25%, kh\'abng \'ae\'ad\'eec ph\'a9n b\'e6 chi ph\'dd qu\'b6n l\'fd c\'f1a tr\'f4 s\'eb ch\'ddnh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i v\'b5 ph\'b6i n\'e9p thu\'d5 chuy\'d3n l\'ee
i nhu\'cbn ra n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i) th\'d7 kh\'abng th\'f9c hi\'d6n vi\'d6c \'aei\'d2u ch\'d8nh l\'b9i, tr\'f5 tr\'ad\'eang h\'eep chi nh\'b8nh n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i c\'e3 y\'aau c\'c7u b\'bbng v\'a8n b\'b6n v\'edi c\'ac quan thu\'d5 \'ae\'d3 \'ae\'ad\'eec x
\'b8c \'ae\'denh ngh\'dca v\'f4 thu\'d5 c\'f1a n\'a8m 1999 theo h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n t\'b9i Th\'abng t\'ad n\'b5y. 
\par 
\par C\'b8c Th\'abng t\'ad sau \'ae\'a9y c\'f1a B\'e9 T\'b5i ch\'ddnh kh\'abng c\'dfn hi\'d6u l\'f9c thi h\'b5nh: 
\par + Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8 90TC/TCT ng\'b5y 10/11/1993 h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d3m v\'d2 ch\'ddnh s\'b8ch thu\'d5 \'ae\'e8i v\'edi Ng\'a9n h\'b5ng li\'aan doanh v\'b5 chi nh\'b8nh ng\'a9n h\'b5ng n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9i Vi\'d6t nam 
\par + Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8 04 TC/TCT ng\'b5y 23/4/1997 h\'ad\'edng d\'c9n m\'e9t s\'e8 \'aei\'d3m v\'d2 ch\'ddnh s\'b8ch thu\'d5 \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8c chi nh\'b8nh t\'e6 ch\'f8c lu\'cbt s\'ad n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i ho\'b9t \'ae\'e9ng t\'b9i Vi\'d6t nam.
\par + Th\'abng t\'ad s\'e8 118 TC/TCT ng\'b5y 26/12/1994 hu\'edng d\'c9n v\'d2 thu\'d5 \'ae\'e8i v\'edi c\'b8c chi nh\'b8nh c\'abng ty thu\'e8c l\'b8 n\'ad\'edc ngo\'b5i t\'b9i Vi\'d6t nam. 
\par 
